{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32568","headline":"塞下曲 · 刘驾","name":"塞下曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勒兵辽水边，风急卷旌旃。\n绝塞阴无草，平沙去尽天。\n下营看斗建，传号信狼烟。\n圣代书青史，当时破虏年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}